      "text": "upon this rock I will build my church, Matt. 16:18. chose twelve, whom also he named apostles, Luke 6:13 (6:12–16). Lord appointed other seventy, Luke 10:1. have chosen you, and ordained you, John 15:16. take part of this ministry and apostleship, Acts 1:25. when they had prayed, they laid their hands on them, Acts 6:6. there were in the church … prophets and teachers, Acts 13:1. ordained them elders in every church, Acts 14:23. apostles and elders came together, Acts 15:6. ye are the body of Christ, and members in particular, 1 Cor. 12:27. built upon the foundation of the apostles and prophets, Eph. 2:20. gave some, apostles; and some, prophets, Eph. 4:11. with the bishops and deacons, Philip. 1:1. ordain elders in every city, Titus 1:5.",
