      "text": "supposing that I spake of the brethren of the church, 1 Ne. 4:26. called the church of God, or the church of Christ, Mosiah 18:17. Mosiah had given Alma the authority over the church, Mosiah 26:8. consecrated to be teachers, and priests, and elders, Alma 4:7. I give unto you power that ye shall baptize, 3 Ne. 11:21. the number of them who had been called, 3 Ne. 12:1. they whom I have chosen to minister, 3 Ne. 13:25. shall one be ordained among you, 3 Ne. 18:5. name whereby we shall call this church, 3 Ne. 27:3. disciples of Jesus had formed a church of Christ, 4 Ne. 1:1. elders of the church, ordained priests and teachers, Moro. 3:1.",
